    puts stderr {Tcsh is an enhanced but completely compatible version of csh, the C}
    puts stderr {shell. Tcsh is a command language interpreter which can be used both as}
    puts stderr {an interactive login shell and as a shell script command processor. Tcsh}
    puts stderr {includes a command line editor, programmable word completion, spelling}
    puts stderr {correction, a history mechanism, job control and a C language like}
    puts stderr {syntax.}
}

